Description: Certbot plugin to authenticate using DNS TXT records via TransIP
 Completes the ACME dns-01 challenge by creating and removing a TXT
 record via the TransIP API (through python3-transip-rest), so
 certificates can be issued for domains hosted at TransIP without
 exposing a web server for http-01 validation.
 .
 Registers as the "dns-transip" certbot plugin.
